Adapted from Paseo and modified for pocket-bots:
- packages/runtime: the timeline item and tool-call detail shapes
  (src/types.ts, src/tool-detail.ts) and the approach of the Claude, Codex,
  OpenCode, Pi and ACP adapters (src/adapters/*.ts);
- packages/app: tool-call presentation (src/shared/tools.ts), sidebar status
  and ordering (src/shared/sidebar.ts), cron parsing and wording
  (src/shared/routines.ts), composer attachments (src/shared/attachments.ts),
  and the web UI's chat stream layout, composer rules, question forms and
  Markdown rendering (src/web/chat/, src/web/lib/markdown.ts).

